# PRES-BRIDGE -- W5-PRES R-100 acceptance: the high-bridge deck layer.
#   under     ALL08: a GI and a Grizzly UNDER the highway bridge (deck cells
#             over land) are covered by the deck
#   flat      the same with deck layering off (the old ground pass: the deck
#             under the units)
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL08U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat deck_spawn MTNK 0 16 land
cheat deck_spawn E1 0 14 land
wait 3
shot under
cheat deck_layers off
wait 2
shot flat
cheat deck_layers on
end
